    "title": "rony",
    "version": "1.4.0",
    "description": "The rony command-line tool for Rony.Net: run a TCP, TLS, UDP or Unix socket mock server from a JSON file, validate it, record the traffic to a real server through a proxy and replay a recording. The repository has a Dockerfile to build an image."
